            "review_title": "Review at Nam An Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Selma\nGothenburg, Sweden25 contributions\n0\n5 star restaurant!\nDec 2017 • Couples\nLooking for a restaurant with top service, fantastic food in a nice and beutiful setting.\nThis is the place! We had visited the market and wanted to get away a bit from the crowd. Entered the bistro Runam and took the elevator up and found this little gem! Lovely place. We had a lunch set menu and loved it. Dont be afraid to tray new things. It was the best meal we had in Vietnamn! This is a first class restaurant with great staff.\nThank you....\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 6, 2018",
