            "review_title": "Review at Nam An Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Lulu\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam92 contributions\n0\nExcellent meal!\nDec 2017 • Friends\nLocated on the 4th floor, the restaurant is very cozy and charming. I was there for my birthday with a group of friends on a Sunday night. The place wasn't crowded as I thought it would be. We booked a table for 4 in advance and we all ordered the set menu since we weren't sure what we wanted for dinner. There were 2 set menu, each with different dishes. Please see my attached photos for reference. \n\nThe service was excellent. Servers are very polite and professional. One thing I noticed that they were actually aware of what they were doing. Every time they brought a new dish to the table, they would kindly inform us what the dish was and how to enjoy it. By the end of the meal, the manager came to our table to check on us and our satisfaction. Well, 5 stars for this gourmet restaurant!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 6, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-10",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
